Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.47,0:22:41.43,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(200,320)}One day the light of love burning in your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.43,0:22:43.35,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}will transcend time
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.35,0:22:47.42,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}and destroy one of this world's dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.42,0:22:51.06,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}as it spirals toward the apocalypse
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.06,0:22:53.91,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}What is it that you seek
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.91,0:22:57.48,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}now that you're done hesitating?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.48,0:23:02.54,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}Is there a glimpse of hope for tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.54,0:23:06.98,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,620)}beyond this greedy admiration?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.10,0:23:12.19,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(200,320)}I want to be armed with the power
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.19,0:23:16.00,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}to shatter even the darkness in my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.00,0:23:19.84,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}just like the ancient magic in my childhood dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.84,0:23:23.72,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the next time I see your innocent smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.72,0:23:27.51,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}In my trembling hands I hold
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.51,0:23:31.34,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the courage of a plucked flower
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.34,0:23:35.18,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}My feelings are all I can rely on;
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.18,0:23:39.05,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the prayer that awakens
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.05,0:23:46.75,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,1620)}the light
Dialogue: 6,0:00:04.21,0:00:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 6,0:00:25.86,0:00:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Homura{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 6,0:00:27.67,0:00:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 6,0:00:30.13,0:00:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell did you just do?!
Dialogue: 6,0:00:34.97,0:00:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. You're that irregularity, huh?
Dialogue: 6,0:00:39.03,0:00:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's some strange magic you've got there.
Dialogue: 6,0:00:41.68,0:00:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 6,0:00:48.99,0:00:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}!
Dialogue: 6,0:00:53.84,0:00:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She's okay. She's just unconscious.
Dialogue: 6,0:00:56.83,0:00:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 6,0:00:58.33,0:00:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose side are you on?
Dialogue: 6,0:01:00.67,0:01:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an ally to those who maintain their composure,
Dialogue: 6,0:01:03.12,0:01:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and an enemy to idiotic aggressors.
Dialogue: 6,0:01:05.71,0:01:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Which are you, Sakura Kyouko?
Dialogue: 6,0:01:08.75,0:01:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 6,0:01:12.30,0:01:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Have we met before?
Dialogue: 6,0:01:14.04,0:01:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 6,0:01:25.32,0:01:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Not when I haven't a clue \Nwhat you've got up your sleeve.
Dialogue: 6,0:01:28.55,0:01:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll back down for today.
Dialogue: 6,0:01:31.37,0:01:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's wise of you.
Dialogue: 6,0:01:39.51,0:01:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You... saved us?
Dialogue: 6,0:01:43.74,0:01:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times must I warn you?
Dialogue: 6,0:01:45.91,0:01:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how big of a fool are you?
Dialogue: 6,0:01:50.79,0:01:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have warned you countless \Ntimes not to get involved, correct?
Dialogue: 6,0:01:57.79,0:01:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 6,0:01:59.34,0:02:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not hold back against a fool.
Dialogue: 6,0:02:09.79,0:02:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Homura{**-chan}... Why?
Dialogue: 6,0:02:13.05,0:02:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, it's obvious she's planning something.
Dialogue: 6,0:02:16.91,0:02:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Be on your toes.
Dialogue: 6,0:02:20.59,0:02:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Akemi Homura, could you be...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:25.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{OP}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:55.05,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Dialogue: 6,0:04:03.31,0:04:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you should be fine for a while.
Dialogue: 6,0:04:05.72,0:04:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's pitch black.
Dialogue: 6,0:04:08.02,0:04:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous now. If you taint it any further, a witch might hatch.
Dialogue: 6,0:04:13.69,0:04:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. Give it to me.
Dialogue: 6,0:04:25.43,0:04:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's harmless now.
Dialogue: 6,0:04:27.90,0:04:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You ate it?!
Dialogue: 6,0:04:29.19,0:04:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just another one of my duties.
Dialogue: 6,0:04:33.33,0:04:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But in order to keep your Soul Gem pure, \Nyou'll need to find a new Grief Seed.
Dialogue: 6,0:04:39.96,0:04:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really that important to keep it clean?
Dialogue: 6,0:04:44.55,0:04:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakura Kyouko was strong, right?
Dialogue: 6,0:04:48.50,0:04:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have spare Grief Seeds,
Dialogue: 6,0:04:50.57,0:04:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you could let loose and waste as much magic as you want in any fight.
Dialogue: 6,0:04:54.06,0:04:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what makes\NKyouko so powerful.
Dialogue: 6,0:04:55.69,0:05:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean you can just sacrifice innocent people to get Grief Seeds.
Dialogue: 6,0:05:01.09,0:05:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The more you use your magic,\Nthe more it taints your Soul Gem.
Dialogue: 6,0:05:05.65,0:05:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka, you'll never stand a chance against Kyouko without collecting Grief Seeds.
Dialogue: 6,0:05:13.88,0:05:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 6,0:05:17.63,0:05:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami{**-san} never had enough Grief Seeds either,
Dialogue: 6,0:05:22.44,0:05:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,yet she was still able to fight just fine.
Dialogue: 6,0:05:24.67,0:05:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are some magical girls just more talented?
Dialogue: 6,0:05:28.50,0:05:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Some definitely are.
Dialogue: 6,0:05:31.68,0:05:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 6,0:05:33.31,0:05:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair at all!
Dialogue: 6,0:05:35.51,0:05:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing you can do about it.
Dialogue: 6,0:05:37.62,0:05:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouko's talented, and she's got the experience to back it up.
Dialogue: 6,0:05:40.23,0:05:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are prodigies with potential to surpass Kyouko, even without any experience.
Dialogue: 6,0:05:46.63,0:05:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Like who?
Dialogue: 6,0:05:48.32,0:05:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaname Madoka.
Dialogue: 6,0:05:52.20,0:05:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka?
Dialogue: 6,0:05:53.64,0:05:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 6,0:05:55.31,0:05:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 6,0:05:56.31,0:06:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why if you really want an edge in your fight with Kyouko, you could always ask her.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:02.96,0:06:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, if she makes a contract with me.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:05.46,0:06:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:08.46,0:06:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my fight.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:11.82,0:06:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get her involved.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:35.79,0:06:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo. What do you want this time?
Dialogue: 6,0:06:37.75,0:06:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to leave this city to you.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:42.02,0:06:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the sudden change of heart?
Dialogue: 6,0:06:44.46,0:06:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls like you are fit to be magical girls.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:48.29,0:06:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Miki Sayaka is not qualified.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:50.09,0:06:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, that was my plan\N from the start, anyway.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:53.43,0:06:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about that Sayaka girl?
Dialogue: 6,0:06:55.60,0:06:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If you just leave her be,\N she'll definitely butt in again.
Dialogue: 6,0:06:58.25,0:07:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to end this as\N peacefully as possible.
Dialogue: 6,0:07:00.95,0:07:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of it. I'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 6,0:07:06.15,0:07:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You still haven't told me the most important thing, though.
Dialogue: 6,0:07:11.21,0:07:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the heck are you?
Dialogue: 6,0:07:14.99,0:07:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's in this for you?
Dialogue: 6,0:07:18.07,0:07:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Walpurgisnacht will descend upon \Nthis city two weeks from today.
Dialogue: 6,0:07:23.04,0:07:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know that?
Dialogue: 6,0:07:25.21,0:07:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a secret.
Dialogue: 6,0:07:26.80,0:07:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, once it's defeated, I'll leave this city.
Dialogue: 6,0:07:31.42,0:07:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do what you want after that.
Dialogue: 6,0:07:36.64,0:07:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Walpurgisnacht, huh?
Dialogue: 6,0:07:39.37,0:07:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd be pretty hard to handle alone, \Nbut we might win if we teamed up.
Dialogue: 6,0:07:50.90,0:07:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Want some?
Dialogue: 6,0:08:00.31,0:08:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use. Too much time has passed.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:03.42,0:08:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see any clues that will lead us to the familiar from last night.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:06.25,0:08:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 6,0:08:09.81,0:08:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sayaka{**-chan}.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:12.63,0:08:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If we keep hunting witches, \Nwon't we run into that girl from yesterday?
Dialogue: 6,0:08:18.38,0:08:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess we can't avoid it.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:21.89,0:08:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should go find her and try to talk things over.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:27.90,0:08:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't, you'll end up fighting again before you know it.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:33.95,0:08:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A fight, huh?
Dialogue: 6,0:08:36.16,0:08:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did last night look like a normal fight to you?
Dialogue: 6,0:08:40.87,0:08:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That was definitely a fight to the death.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:45.04,0:08:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the first few blows weren't lethal.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:48.07,0:08:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Halfway through, we were both \Nseriously trying to finish each other off.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:52.68,0:08:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But... that's even worse!
Dialogue: 6,0:08:55.51,0:08:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And you want me to\N try to "talk it over"?
Dialogue: 6,0:08:57.60,0:08:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:58.98,0:09:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,She's trying to use human beings as bait just to get more Grief Seeds.
Dialogue: 6,0:09:03.59,0:09:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to get \Nalong with someone like that?
Dialogue: 6,0:09:06.87,0:09:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}, you became a \Nmagical girl to fight witches, right?
Dialogue: 6,0:09:11.77,0:09:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl isn't a witch.\N She's a magical girl like you!
Dialogue: 6,0:09:17.17,0:09:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you give her a chance, I'm sure you'll find a way to become friends.
Dialogue: 6,0:09:21.46,0:09:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She does things differently, but she's \Nalso trying to hunt down witches, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.79,0:09:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you.
Dialogue: 6,0:09:28.08,0:09:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And Homura{**-chan} too.
Dialogue: 6,0:09:31.33,0:09:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mami{**-san} hadn't\Nfought with Homura{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 6,0:09:34.99,0:09:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That wouldn't have happened!
Dialogue: 6,0:09:36.77,0:09:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw her, didn't you?
Dialogue: 6,0:09:39.05,0:09:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She waited for Mami{**-san} to get killed before she came to defeat the witch!
Dialogue: 6,0:09:43.95,0:09:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She let Mami{**-san} die because she wanted the Grief Seed!
Dialogue: 6,0:09:48.48,0:09:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what happened...
Dialogue: 6,0:09:50.48,0:09:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That transfer student\Nis the same as Kyouko!
Dialogue: 6,0:09:54.96,0:09:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They only think about themselves!
Dialogue: 6,0:09:58.59,0:10:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I understand that now.
Dialogue: 6,0:10:00.88,0:10:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami{**-san} was an exception.
Dialogue: 6,0:10:03.37,0:10:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,All the other magical girls\N are like those two!
Dialogue: 6,0:10:07.45,0:10:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 6,0:10:08.62,0:10:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That familiar from last night might've been small, but it could still kill someone!
Dialogue: 6,0:10:13.00,0:10:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And who knows, its next target could even be your parents!
Dialogue: 6,0:10:17.38,0:10:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe even Takkun!
Dialogue: 6,0:10:19.14,0:10:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you still say you don't care?
Dialogue: 6,0:10:21.18,0:10:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you forgive someone\Nif they just let that happen?
Dialogue: 6,0:10:24.86,0:10:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not just fighting against witches.
Dialogue: 6,0:10:28.52,0:10:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted this power to fight to protect the people I care about.
Dialogue: 6,0:10:32.23,0:10:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'll fight anyone\Nworse than the witches.
Dialogue: 6,0:10:37.86,0:10:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if that person is\Nanother magical girl.
Dialogue: 6,0:10:42.27,0:10:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 6,0:10:48.69,0:10:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyubey, say something to her...
Dialogue: 6,0:10:51.71,0:10:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I can tell her is\Nthat she's being too reckless.
Dialogue: 6,0:10:56.00,0:11:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka currently has no chance of winning against Akemi Homura or Sakura Kyouko.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:01.77,0:11:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But she won't listen to me.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:45.66,0:11:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't sleep?
Dialogue: 6,0:11:47.25,0:11:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Can we talk?
Dialogue: 6,0:12:01.79,0:12:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A friend of mine is in a tough situation.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:05.67,0:12:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What she's doing and\N saying probably isn't wrong,
Dialogue: 6,0:12:10.65,0:12:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but the more she tries to do\Nwhat's right, the worse it gets.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:17.18,0:12:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That happens a lot.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:20.35,0:12:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It sucks, but you can't expect a happy ending just by doing what's right all the time.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:27.36,0:12:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, the more people get stubborn and insist that they're in the right,
Dialogue: 6,0:12:32.65,0:12:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,the farther away happiness gets.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:36.12,0:12:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair if you can't be happy even \Nthough you're not doing the wrong things.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:42.00,0:12:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:43.24,0:12:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think I should do?
Dialogue: 6,0:12:46.36,0:12:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a problem that can be\Nsolved by someone not involved.
Dialogue: 6,0:12:56.05,0:13:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to solve this, \Neven if it's not the nicest way to do it?
Dialogue: 6,0:13:00.01,0:13:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:01.98,0:13:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is\N make a mistake for her.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:03.76,0:13:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 6,0:13:05.55,0:13:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody has to be in the wrong to\Nbalance out her need to be in the right.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:10.43,0:13:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something wrong?
Dialogue: 6,0:13:12.18,0:13:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell a white lie, or run\Naway from something scary.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:16.32,0:13:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you realize that was\Nactually the best choice in the end.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:22.04,0:13:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes when you hit a dead end with no real alternatives,
Dialogue: 6,0:13:25.62,0:13:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,making a big mistake is an option.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:29.69,0:13:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But do you think she'll understand that I'm doing it for her own good?
Dialogue: 6,0:13:34.33,0:13:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She may or may not.\N Especially at first.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:39.18,0:13:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you it might not\Nbe the nicest way to do it.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:42.89,0:13:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But would you rather give up on her,\N or give her the wrong idea about you?
Dialogue: 6,0:13:49.22,0:13:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, you grew up\Nto be a good girl.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:52.70,0:13:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't lie, and you\Ndon't do anything bad.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:56.24,0:13:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always trying\Nhard to do what is right.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:59.80,0:14:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're already a wonderful child.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:04.89,0:14:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you should start learning how to make mistakes before you grow up.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:10.49,0:14:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Learning how to make mistakes?
Dialogue: 6,0:14:13.69,0:14:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You recover from injury\Nfaster when you're young.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:16.47,0:14:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you learn how to fall down now, \Nit'll be easier for you later on.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:21.76,0:14:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When you get older,\Nmaking mistakes gets harder.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:26.64,0:14:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The more things you're responsible for, \Nthe less mistakes you can make.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:30.63,0:14:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:33.50,0:14:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that hard?
Dialogue: 6,0:14:35.77,0:14:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Being an adult is hard for everybody.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:39.39,0:14:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why they let you drink.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:44.29,0:14:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to grow up and drink with you.
Dialogue: 6,0:14:47.78,0:14:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get older. As difficult as it is, it's fun being an adult.
Dialogue: 6,0:15:10.93,0:15:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kamijou{**-san} was released from the hospital yesterday.
Dialogue: 6,0:15:15.69,0:15:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,His rehabilitation was going well, \Nso his schedule was moved up.
Dialogue: 6,0:15:20.19,0:15:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I see...
Dialogue: 6,0:15:49.51,0:15:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Going home without even seeing him?
Dialogue: 6,0:15:52.17,0:15:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been chasing him around all day.
Dialogue: 6,0:15:54.97,0:15:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 6,0:15:55.98,0:15:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know all about it. The little rich boy who lives here, right?
Dialogue: 6,0:15:59.24,0:16:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The one you made a contract with Kyubey for.
Dialogue: 6,0:16:02.52,0:16:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Christ. You wasted your only chance for a miracle on something that stupid?
Dialogue: 6,0:16:09.23,0:16:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you know?!
Dialogue: 6,0:16:10.97,0:16:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A hell of a lot more than you, dummy.
Dialogue: 6,0:16:13.18,0:16:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic is only supposed to be used to grant wishes for yourself.
Dialogue: 6,0:16:18.03,0:16:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No good comes out of\Nusing it for someone else.
Dialogue: 6,0:16:23.26,0:16:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't Tomoe Mami even\N teach you that much?
Dialogue: 6,0:16:30.30,0:16:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There are better ways of making a guy you love fall for you.
Dialogue: 6,0:16:34.93,0:16:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you've got\Nall that magic now.
Dialogue: 6,0:16:37.62,0:16:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 6,0:16:38.05,0:16:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go in there and break his hands and legs so bad, \Nhe'll never be able to use them again.
Dialogue: 6,0:16:44.56,0:16:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Make him so helpless that he won't\Nbe able to do anything without you.
Dialogue: 6,0:16:48.19,0:16:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Do that, and he'll be\Nyours and yours alone.
Dialogue: 6,0:16:51.19,0:16:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Both his body and his heart.
Dialogue: 6,0:16:55.95,0:17:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't have the guts,\Nthen I could do it for you.
Dialogue: 6,0:17:00.39,0:17:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think of it as a favor\Nto my fellow magical girl.
Dialogue: 6,0:17:02.45,0:17:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no sweat.
Dialogue: 6,0:17:05.57,0:17:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I will... never forgive you.
Dialogue: 6,0:17:09.78,0:17:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you down this time...
Dialogue: 6,0:17:11.71,0:17:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take this someplace else, then.
Dialogue: 6,0:17:14.73,0:17:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't want to attract a crowd.
Dialogue: 6,0:17:22.50,0:17:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody has to be in the wrong to\Nbalance out her need to be in the right.
Dialogue: 6,0:17:28.47,0:17:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But how could I...
Dialogue: 6,0:17:30.68,0:17:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Madoka!
Dialogue: 6,0:17:32.00,0:17:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Madoka!
Dialogue: 6,0:17:33.23,0:17:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hurry! Sayaka's in trouble!
Dialogue: 6,0:17:35.36,0:17:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Follow me!
Dialogue: 6,0:17:44.90,0:17:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't have to hold back here.
Dialogue: 6,0:17:47.12,0:17:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's party time.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:07.25,0:18:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Sayaka{**-chan}!
Dialogue: 6,0:18:10.59,0:18:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Madoka!
Dialogue: 6,0:18:11.95,0:18:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get in the way.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:13.19,0:18:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't even any of your business.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:15.33,0:18:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is definitely wrong!
Dialogue: 6,0:18:17.65,0:18:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph. Annoying jerks sure\N attract annoying friends.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:21.69,0:18:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what sort of\Nfriends you have, then.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:24.79,0:18:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:25.95,0:18:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't what we agreed on.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:27.48,0:18:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you to keep\Nyour hands off of Miki Sayaka.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:29.87,0:18:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your method wouldn't\N get the message across!
Dialogue: 6,0:18:33.02,0:18:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not backing down either way.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:35.20,0:18:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take her on, then. Stay out of it.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:38.93,0:18:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got until I finish eating this.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:41.48,0:18:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's plenty of time.
Dialogue: 6,0:18:43.41,0:18:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me!
Dialogue: 6,0:18:46.06,0:18:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 6,0:18:59.43,0:19:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, what the hell?!
Dialogue: 6,0:19:01.56,0:19:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I hadn't...
Dialogue: 6,0:19:04.14,0:19:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}?
Dialogue: 6,0:19:07.41,0:19:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That was bad, Madoka.
Dialogue: 6,0:19:10.46,0:19:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you just throw\N away your friend like that?
Dialogue: 6,0:19:13.37,0:19:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 6,0:19:14.46,0:19:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What... What are you saying?
Dialogue: 6,0:19:19.58,0:19:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 6,0:19:22.44,0:19:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this...
Dialogue: 6,0:19:24.39,0:19:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,She's dead!
Dialogue: 6,0:19:36.85,0:19:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}?
Dialogue: 6,0:19:38.19,0:19:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sayaka{**-chan}?
Dialogue: 6,0:19:39.94,0:19:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up! Say something! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 6,0:19:45.57,0:19:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want this to happen!
Dialogue: 6,0:19:47.79,0:19:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}!
Dialogue: 6,0:19:49.70,0:19:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 6,0:19:53.83,0:19:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 6,0:19:54.97,0:20:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You magical girls can only control your\Nbodies from 100 meters away, at most.
Dialogue: 6,0:20:01.72,0:20:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,100 meters?!
Dialogue: 6,0:20:03.31,0:20:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 6,0:20:06.12,0:20:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You normally carry them with you, \Nso accidents like this are rare.
Dialogue: 6,0:20:12.89,0:20:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Kyubey?
Dialogue: 6,0:20:14.74,0:20:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Save her! Don't let Sayaka{**-chan} die!
Dialogue: 6,0:20:19.55,0:20:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, that isn't Sayaka.\NIt's just an empty shell.
Dialogue: 6,0:20:24.74,0:20:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You just threw Sayaka away.
Dialogue: 6,0:20:28.31,0:20:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 6,0:20:33.97,0:20:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't just ask you to fight\Nwitches with a fragile human body.
Dialogue: 6,0:20:41.13,0:20:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A magical girl's old body is nothing\Nmore than a piece of external hardware.
Dialogue: 6,0:20:47.92,0:20:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your actual soul is given a much safer,
Dialogue: 6,0:20:50.52,0:20:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,compact form that is capable of controlling magic much more efficiently.
Dialogue: 6,0:20:57.65,0:21:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's part of my job, when I complete a magical girl's contract.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:01.65,0:21:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I extract your souls and\Nturn them into Soul Gems.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:06.03,0:21:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do to us?
Dialogue: 6,0:21:09.12,0:21:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard! You basically\Nturned us into zombies!
Dialogue: 6,0:21:14.11,0:21:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it more convenient?
Dialogue: 6,0:21:18.93,0:21:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if your heart is torn to shreds \Nor you lose every drop of blood,
Dialogue: 6,0:21:22.76,0:21:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,your body can be fixed in\Nno time with magical healing.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:27.05,0:21:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're basically invincible, \Nprovided that your Soul Gem is intact.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:31.10,0:21:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that far more advantageous than \Nfighting with a human body full of vital organs?
Dialogue: 6,0:21:36.48,0:21:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's terrible... That's too awful.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:43.61,0:21:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all the same.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:45.81,0:21:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You always react like this when\Nyou're told what's really going on.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:50.09,0:21:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't get it.
Dialogue: 6,0:21:51.84,0:21:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are humans so touchy about the placement of their souls?
Dialogue: 6,0:22:22.79,0:22:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 6,0:22:24.08,0:22:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.07,0:22:26.12,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.04,0:23:56.08,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 6,0:23:58.06,0:24:03.01,Default,,110,0,0,,{\an1}You had a wish important enough to commit yourself to a life of battle, did you not?
Dialogue: 6,0:24:03.01,0:24:05.86,Default,,110,0,0,,{\an1}And your wish came true, didn't it?
Dialogue: 6,0:24:07.13,0:24:09.77,Default,,110,0,0,,{\an1}Can you accept your true feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.11,0:03:03.74,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I'll walk upon this Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:05.75,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}and pierce this shadowy veil of unease,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:09.42,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}as many times as necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.55,0:03:30.85,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}with these unwavering feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.72,0:03:46.53,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}the beautiful blue sky will always be waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.31,0:02:28.71,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,0)}I'll never forget the promises we exchanged
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:31.19,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I still see it when I close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.19,0:02:32.81,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I'll move forward as I cast off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.81,0:02:36.69,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}this darkness engulfing me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.97,0:02:52.80,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,480)}How long will it be before
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.80,0:02:59.11,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I see that lost future again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.53,0:03:48.85,Opening-Connect-English-night,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}So I won't be afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.85,0:03:55.01,Opening-Connect-English-night,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,1020)}No matter what happens next, I won't give in
